    <description>A growth of wood and terramass that has multiple protruding sacs of endosap, allowing it to shed a decent amount of light.
\nThe emission from the lamp applies a thin protective layer to anything that comes nearby, but the coating melts away extremely quickly.
\n\nThe lamp itself doesn't root that deeply, and requires manual renourishment. You will need to replace it's sap yearly for it to retain it's glow.</description>
